The React dashboard should support both automatic and manual refresh.

Requirements:
- Automatically refresh execution status every 30 seconds while the dashboard is open.
- Provide a manual Refresh button.
- Display the current duration of executions with Running status.
- Stop polling when the dashboard is not active, where practical.
- Avoid unnecessary API requests.

